WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.850
July 13th, 2019.

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:08.610
Scientist Roy Funk is journeying to northern
Brazil.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:15.250
He's here to investigate something bizarre
revealed from space.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.520
You can't let an opportunity.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:25.080
Like this pass to see something that's never
been seen in a very real sense.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:35.310
High over the forests of the Caatinga region,
the GeoEye one satellite captures an expanse

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.250
of barren soil recently cleared by ranchers.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.840
You see a semi-arid landscape with some kind
of pock marks.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:48.300
Almost looks to me like it could have been
bomb craters or some type of holes in the

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:48.930
ground.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:54.090
Analysts count more than 300 circles across
